@startuml 42-timing-submission
!include ../../_style.iuml
title Nós no Cabo v1 — Timing diagram: a submitter who leaves early (seconds since submit)

robust "Website.status (catalog)" as STATUS
binary "Tab open" as TAB
concise "Status checks (SPA)" as POLL
concise "Push subscription" as PUSH
robust "Draft (localStorage)" as DRAFT

@0
STATUS is checking
TAB is high
POLL is "every 15 s"
PUSH is none
DRAFT is checking

@5
PUSH is stored

@90
TAB is low
POLL is stopped

@150
STATUS is published
PUSH is "sent, deleted"

@165
PUSH is none

@0 <-> @90 : checks every 15 s (the active window would last 2 min)
@90 <-> @150 : nothing polls

highlight 150 to 165 #FFF3E0 : notification shown by sw.js

note bottom of DRAFT : still "checking" here; the next visit's status\ncheck drops it (or it expires after 7 days)

@enduml
